      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCESS ADA (1) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors seven starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (36.72) at Nowra over 630m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to feature in the finish again. SHIRUKU (8) ran below best last time finishing fifth (30.35) over 520m at Wentworth Park from Box 4. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Leading chance. ABSCONDING (2) was out of placings last time (29.90) at Wentworth Park in a NG, finishing sixth and beaten 7 lengths. Yet to taste defeat in four runs from this draw. Can hit the frame with the right run. LUCKY BISCUIT (4) raced on the pace and got home last start. Right in the mix.",
